abstract: >-
  An experimental architecture that splits one task identity across two
  functionally specialized model processes, Strategist and Executor, and
  enforces cooperation through mutually exclusive tool ownership, permission
  locks, independent verification, typed communication, durable checkpoints,
  and an append-only evidence ledger. Optional modules borrow functional
  inspiration from neuroscience while making no claim of biological fidelity
  or machine consciousness.
